    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/0134ac55cf932dd9dc2eac5700a60967.avif?t=1706645271\" width=333 height=111 /></span><br>Flawless Dream is a roguelike in which you must explore a pre-existing dungeon created by the gods to discover treasures, fight creatures, find the goddess' rewards and collect mana crystals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/b8211be9bb5a8d4ced70ed742be8ee33.poster.avif?t=1706645271\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/b8211be9bb5a8d4ced70ed742be8ee33.webm?t=1706645271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>To pass this challenges, you have the option to make a pact with the devil to increase the power that accompanies you. However, there is something special about this deal. Not only does the demon need you to gain power, but if you give him enough of what he wants, he will add some of his warm memories to your memory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/144a3dac239173e61f1af51d20f2a34a.avif?t=1706645271\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>By taking the tests of the gods, collecting lots of mana crystals, and buying your hot memories from the devil, you'll be able to sleep easy now, experiencing hot moments you never imagined!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/9b887ed973d5254880a1e52fd46b452e.avif?t=1706645271\" width=800 height=532 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/92e928675b23798253f4f50b332a6d0f.avif?t=1706645271\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/96e36b25ee5f4bd29a1d4f64fcab6fa4.avif?t=1706645271\" width=600 height=111 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore unique dungeon created by the gods.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Increase your power by overcoming difficult challenges.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make deals with the devil to not only gain power, but also to add warm memories to your memory.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect mana crystals to progress and earn rewards.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sleep soundly as you experience unimaginably special moments.</li></ul>Flawless Dream offers a roguelike experience that delivers both action and emotional depth. Pass the test of the gods and dive into an unforgettable dream!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/0134ac55cf932dd9dc2eac5700a60967.avif?t=1706645271\" width=333 height=111 /></span><br>Flawless Dream is a roguelike in which you must explore a pre-existing dungeon created by the gods to discover treasures, fight creatures, find the goddess' rewards and collect mana crystals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/b8211be9bb5a8d4ced70ed742be8ee33.poster.avif?t=1706645271\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/b8211be9bb5a8d4ced70ed742be8ee33.webm?t=1706645271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>To pass this challenges, you have the option to make a pact with the devil to increase the power that accompanies you. However, there is something special about this deal. Not only does the demon need you to gain power, but if you give him enough of what he wants, he will add some of his warm memories to your memory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/144a3dac239173e61f1af51d20f2a34a.avif?t=1706645271\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>By taking the tests of the gods, collecting lots of mana crystals, and buying your hot memories from the devil, you'll be able to sleep easy now, experiencing hot moments you never imagined!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/9b887ed973d5254880a1e52fd46b452e.avif?t=1706645271\" width=800 height=532 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/92e928675b23798253f4f50b332a6d0f.avif?t=1706645271\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762640/extras/96e36b25ee5f4bd29a1d4f64fcab6fa4.avif?t=1706645271\" width=600 height=111 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore unique dungeon created by the gods.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Increase your power by overcoming difficult challenges.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make deals with the devil to not only gain power, but also to add warm memories to your memory.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect mana crystals to progress and earn rewards.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sleep soundly as you experience unimaginably special moments.</li></ul>Flawless Dream offers a roguelike experience that delivers both action and emotional depth. Pass the test of the gods and dive into an unforgettable dream!",
